msgstr "A Nano 33 BLE Sense a következőkkel érkezik:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:714
msgid "``/flash`` — **64 KB** FAT filesystem, read/write."
msgstr "``/flash`` — **64 KB** FAT fájlrendszer, írható/olvasható."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-nano-33-ble-sense.rst:716
msgid ""
"The Nano 33 BLE Sense build does not include a ROMFS; ship Python modules on"
" ``/flash`` directly."
msgstr ""
"A Nano 33 BLE Sense build nem tartalmaz ROMFS-t; a Python modulokat "
"közvetlenül a ``/flash``\\ -en szállítsa."

